NOTE ON MODEL WEIGHTS

This license covers the LocalASR source code only. Speech recognition models
downloaded by the application remain under their own licenses:

  * OpenAI Whisper and its derivatives (including faster-whisper conversions,
    whisper.cpp GGML files and community fine-tunes) - MIT License
  * Vosk / Kaldi models - Apache License 2.0
  * NVIDIA NeMo models (if added manually) - CC-BY-4.0

Model files are fetched directly from Hugging Face / alphacephei.com and are
never redistributed in this repository.
